# ---------- curriculum
LV=[('A1','Breakthrough','Basic user','Can understand and use familiar everyday expressions and very basic phrases, introduce themselves and others, and interact simply if the other person speaks slowly.',
 {'Listening':'Familiar words and very basic phrases about self, family and surroundings.','Reading':'Names, notices, simple forms and menus.','Spoken interaction':'Ask and answer simple questions on immediate needs.','Spoken production':'Describe where you live and people you know.','Writing':'A postcard, a form with personal details.'},
 'Essere and avere, regular presente, articles and gender, plural nouns, numbers, c\'è / ci sono, basic prepositions, piacere.','CI Principiante · CI Elementare · Al Caffè','ci1'),
('A2','Waystage','Basic user','Can understand frequently used expressions about immediate areas of relevance, communicate in simple routine tasks and describe their background and immediate needs.',
 {'Listening':'Short clear announcements and the main point of simple messages.','Reading':'Short simple texts, ads, timetables, personal letters.','Spoken interaction':'Short social exchanges, shopping, travel, bookings.','Spoken production':'Describe family, education, routine, past events.','Writing':'Short notes and simple personal letters.'},
 'Passato prossimo with essere and avere, imperfetto, reflexive verbs, direct and indirect object pronouns, futuro semplice, comparatives, ci and ne.','CI Intermedio · CI Avanzato · A Tavola · In Viaggio','ci3'),
('B1','Threshold','Independent user','Can understand the main points of clear standard input on familiar matters, deal with most travel situations, describe experiences and give brief reasons for opinions and plans.',
 {'Listening':'Main points of radio, TV and talk on familiar topics.','Reading':'Everyday texts, descriptions of events and feelings.','Spoken interaction':'Enter unprepared conversation on familiar topics.','Spoken production':'Narrate a story, a plot, an experience, with reasons.','Writing':'Connected text on familiar topics, personal letters.'},
 'Condizionale presente, congiuntivo presente, pronomi combinati, trapassato prossimo, relative pronouns, imperative with pronouns.','Chiacchierando · CILS / CELI B1 preparation','ps4'),
('B2','Vantage','Independent user','Can understand the main ideas of complex text, interact with fluency and spontaneity, and produce clear detailed text, explaining a viewpoint.',
 {'Listening':'Extended speech and lectures, most TV news.','Reading':'Articles and reports with a stance; contemporary prose.','Spoken interaction':'Fluent interaction with native speakers; sustain views.','Spoken production':'Clear detailed descriptions; pros and cons.','Writing':'Essays and reports, argued.'},
 'Congiuntivo imperfetto and trapassato, periodo ipotetico (all types), passive voice and si passivante, gerundio, connectives.','Advanced cohorts on demand',None),
('C1','Effective operational proficiency','Proficient user','Can understand demanding, longer texts, express ideas fluently and spontaneously, and use language flexibly for social, academic and professional purposes.',
 {'Listening':'Extended speech even when not clearly structured.','Reading':'Long complex factual and literary texts; specialised articles.','Spoken interaction':'Express yourself fluently without searching for words.','Spoken production':'Detailed descriptions of complex subjects.','Writing':'Well-structured text on complex subjects; style choices.'},
 'Indirect speech and concordanza dei tempi, register and formality, nominalisation, advanced connectives, passato remoto in reading.','Advanced cohorts on demand',None),
('C2','Mastery','Proficient user','Can understand virtually everything heard or read, summarise from different sources and express themselves spontaneously and precisely, differentiating finer shades of meaning.',
 {'Listening':'Any kind of spoken language, live or broadcast, at native speed.','Reading':'Virtually all forms of written language.','Spoken interaction':'Idiomatic, precise, effortless.','Spoken production':'Clear, smoothly flowing, well-structured argument.','Writing':'Complex letters, reports, reviews of literary works.'},
 'Stylistic and regional variation, literary tenses, idiom and collocation, rhetoric.','Advanced cohorts on demand',None)]
